WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.810
- I heard your girls in "Bridesmaids"

00:00:01.810 --> 00:00:04.343
went to a strip club for research.

00:00:04.343 --> 00:00:05.176
- [Rose] Oh yeah.

00:00:05.176 --> 00:00:06.009
- Is that true?

00:00:06.009 --> 00:00:07.125
- We did, yeah.

00:00:07.125 --> 00:00:09.930
Kristen Wiig hired a party
bus or a huge bus, you know

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:11.800
and we all got on and there was like,

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:14.050
a bar and this was pre-COVID obviously,

00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:16.630
this was 10 years ago, and we drove, yeah.

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:18.980
We went to the strip club
in LA and it was, yeah.

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:20.770
Most of the women in
the audience were like,

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:22.900
getting married or like bridal parties.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:25.710
So it was like a lot of that
little like throwing off

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:28.080
like, what do you call it when the like,

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:29.460
you're on a hen's night?

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:31.300
Well, you don't say that
here, bachelorette party?

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:32.260
- A hen's night.

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:33.919
- [Rose] That's what we say in Australia.

00:00:33.919 --> 00:00:34.752
- I'm gonna say that from now on.

00:00:34.752 --> 00:00:35.585
- A hen's night.

00:00:35.585 --> 00:00:36.990
- Yes, all the hens.

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:37.823
- The hens.

00:00:37.823 --> 00:00:40.070
So it was hysterical, it was hysterical.

00:00:40.070 --> 00:00:42.530
It was a great bonding night
and this was all Kristen Wiig,

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:44.680
you know, she's completely,
she's just so creative

00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:47.170
and eccentric and wonderful and loving.

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:48.650
- And what a team building exercise.

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:50.620
- It was very team building exercise.

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:54.540
I got on stage at one point and yeah

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:56.610
but I was wearing a very expensive blouse

00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:57.690
and he was very oily.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:59.670
So it was a little bit
like, oh, this is like,

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:01.253
this costs a lot of money.

